[00:13.16]Life depends on Jehovah’s Word,
[00:18.76]All the things he has said.
[00:24.84]We must live not on bread alone;
[00:30.96]Live by his Word instead.
[00:37.08]Even now we have peace and joy,
[00:43.24]Future blessings assured.
[00:49.07](Chorus)
[00:49.22]Man must live not on bread alone;
[00:55.19]Life depends on God’s Word.
[01:01.50]There we find what we daily need;
[01:07.52]Life depends on God’s Word.
[01:13.86]True accounts in God’s written Word
[01:19.90]Tell about those of old.
[01:26.06]Men and women who walked in faith—
[01:32.12]They were loyal and bold.
[01:38.28]We’re encouraged each time we read
[01:44.46]All they did and endured.
[01:50.29](Chorus)
[01:50.44]Man must live not on bread alone;
[01:56.56]Life depends on God’s Word.
[02:02.62]There we find what we daily need;
[02:08.80]Life depends on God’s Word.
[02:16.16]Day by day as we read God’s Word,
[02:43.68]He gives comfort and hope.
[02:50.88]When the trials of life arise,
[02:57.47]He gives wisdom to cope.
[03:04.24]May we treasure within our heart
[03:10.84]All we’ve read and we’ve heard.
[03:16.87](Chorus)
[03:17.02]Man must live not on bread alone;
[03:23.06]Life depends on God’s Word.
[03:29.32]There we find what we daily need;
[03:39.18]Life depends on God’s Word.
